  "description": "MIHJIZ crystallizes in the orthorhombic crystal system with space group P b c n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C76 H40 Eu4 F36 N8 O20,2(C3 H6 O1). From the CIF bond table, Eu1 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors; Eu2 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors; Eu3 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors; Eu4 (Eu) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.865-3.972 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 104.94-110.91°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C76H40N8O20F36Eu4.",
